<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46522" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωόω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>impregnate</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζωοῦσα θορή</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aret.
					<u>SD</u>
					2.5
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
				<u>Gaur.</u>
				1.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				3.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>quicken, make alive</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Ps.</u>
				79(80).18
			</span></i>; <i>endow with life</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἑαυτὸ οὐσιοῖ καὶ ζωοῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					80
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Phlp.
				<u>in GC</u>
				200.6
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Alim.</u>
				38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				19.174
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				180
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phlp.
				<u>in GC</u>
				151.5
			</span></i>, Id. <i>in de An.</i><i><span class="en">
				64.7
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θηρίον ζωωθὲν τὸ σῶμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plot.
					1.1.10
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				4.4.28
			</span></i>; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γῆ] ἐζωωμένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.7.12
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, of putrescent plants, <i>breed worms</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				5.18.2
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζῳο-</span>).</div>
